[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4680.07, "timestamp": "01:18:00", "text": "再联系那个人了，因为之前发生的事我们已经断绝了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4684.229, "timestamp": "01:18:04", "text": "关系，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4687.35, "timestamp": "01:18:07", "text": "那我能用吗？就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4690.95, "timestamp": "01:18:10", "text": "授权而言，就像是别人送的礼物一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4695.03, "timestamp": "01:18:15", "text": "我不知道，如果是委托"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4696.709, "timestamp": "01:18:16", "text": "作品，那我拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4700.95, "timestamp": "01:18:20", "text": "所有权，我已经付钱给他们了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4711.75, "timestamp": "01:18:31", "text": "所以，我最近在推特上看到了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4715.83, "timestamp": "01:18:35", "text": "事情，比如 Holive 那种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4721.189, "timestamp": "01:18:41", "text": "艺术家之间的纷争，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4723.99, "timestamp": "01:18:43", "text": "看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4727.189, "timestamp": "01:18:47", "text": "一些艺术家对他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4731.99, "timestamp": "01:18:51", "text": "艺术作品或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4734.63, "timestamp": "01:18:54", "text": "他们所画的角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4739.03, "timestamp": "01:18:59", "text": "应该如何行动等等有特定的诠释，这感觉也挺奇怪的。 所以，当那个叫"}]